message_body_html:
…treaming API

#! 
#! [euphoria-flink] fix failing tests
#! 
#! [euphoria-flink] use singletonIterator

The nanos field is specified with
// Non-negative fractions of a second at nanosecond resolution.
Zero is a thus a valid value and the test incorrectly fails if it occurs.

