rather than reflect.DeepEquals to check the equality of 2 proto
messages. Using bytes.Equals for the byte slices for the same reason.

Change-Id: Id08a8eaa28a9207c599a20637cfd9f8a447052b3
Reviewed-on: <a href="https://team-review.git.corp.google.com/120272" rel="nofollow">https://team-review.git.corp.google.com/120272</a>
