Verified-BuildAndTest: kokoro &lt;noreply+kokoro@google.com&gt;
Reviewed-by: Flavio Fiszman &lt;flaviocf@google.com&gt;

Some coders are now transmitted only via URN. Our code needs
to recognize the URN and build the appropriate Coder instance. We
do so by translating the Fn API info to CoderRefs, and regular
serialized Coders are also CoderRefs. Then we translate all CoderRefs
into Coders.

