Verified-BuildAndTest: kokoro &lt;noreply+kokoro@google.com&gt;
Reviewed-by: Henning Rohde &lt;herohde@google.com&gt;

The FnAPI spec requires windowed values to be transmitted in a single
message. This change modifies the encoding scheme to ensure that
behavior. Without this change, the value may not be part of the message
the harness receives, causing it to misbehave.

